can use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the map view’s delegate to receive notifications when your control is tapped,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by implementing the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:annotation:calloutAccessoryControlTapped:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method. If the view you specify does not descend from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIControl"},{"text":", your view is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"responsible for handling any touch events within its bounds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If this method is absent from the delegate, or if it returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"standard callout view has no accessory view on its right side. The return value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of this method is ignored if ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:"},{"text":" is present in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the delegate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To display a view on the callout’s left side, implement the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Related examples","anchor":"Related-examples","level":4,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to modify the view that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the right side of the standard callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},